    {
      "bbox": [
        316,
        1280,
        1856,
        1665
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Departments have transmitted schedules covering those improvements made during the years 1951 and 1952 to my Board of Management Improvement. However, to enable the Budget Director to compile the required information, those improvements which were made during the years 1948, 1949 and 1950 will be needed.",
