    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        320,
        1683,
        1858,
        2317
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Accordingly, you are directed to report to the Director of the Budget those improvements made in your department covering the period from January 1, 1948 to December 31, 1950. I urge the complete cooperation of all agency heads in the transmission of this material. The reports must be available not later than February 10, 1953. Standard forms for reporting are attached. Additional forms may be obtained from the Bureau of the Budget.",
